{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22393","headline":"村居卧病三首 一 · 白居易","name":"村居卧病三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"戚戚抱羸病，悠悠度朝暮。\n夏木才结阴，秋兰已含露。\n前日巢中卵，化作雏飞去。\n昨日穴中虫，蜕爲蝉上树。\n四时未尝歇，一物不暂住。\n唯有病客心，沈然独如故。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22393.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22393","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}